[gd_scene format=3]

; The Sacristy, behind the locked door in the Narthex's west wall (map offset (-26, 0)): the side chapel where the makers
; kept what they would not carry down. Its key lies on the Scriptorium's gallery, so it is a way back to the start once Mag-grip
; has taken the pilgrim up the Undercroft's flue. A dead end: a power-up (defense) on a dais under a shaft of light, a
; plate, an arcade before a dressed back wall. The way out is the doorway east, back through the door (it needs the key too: only a holder
; of it is ever here). The foot of the west wall is false: behind it, the Cell, a secret.

